{"type": "vertex_text", "round": 1, "text": "An exhaustive source-fidelity review was performed. Every claim limitation, numbered part, figure brief, drawing description, and statement of structure, relationship, and function in the detailed description and summary was traced to an affirmative statement in the inventor's disclosure. One unsupported assertion was found in the brief for FIG. 2, where a sensing connection was described with a specific topology that the inventor did not disclose. A corrective fix has been provided to remove the unsupported assertion and align the figure brief with the disclosure and the other figures. With this correction, the application text is fully supported by the inventor's source material and is internally consistent. All other checks for claim support, terminology, internal logic, and drafting formalities were passed."}
